        -- the per-label bounds of the irrelevant parts in `d(X)` (P1 (3.128), open)
        (Bτ : {τ // τ ∈ 𝒯E} → ℝ) (_ : ∀ τ, 0 ≤ Bτ τ)
        (_ : ∀ τ : {τ // τ ∈ 𝒯E}, ∀ r ∈ XiCRaw (Gj τ) (compWeight 3 S.a₁) S.ν τ.1.1 bL
          (bL ^ 2 * T.t + xiK2 3 3 2 * δ₃ + xiK2 3 3 2 * δfl),
